    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42245" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sagalessos</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sagalass-</span></b> ), i, f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an important town of
				Pisidia</i>, whose ruins are found near the mod. <i>Aghtasan</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 27,
				24, § 94</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Sagalassēnus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Sagalessos</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					38, 15, 9</span></i>
			.</div>
